{"id":"cab977dba02a89de","group":"28","path":"28/28-prop-unique-decoding-radius.md","title":"Half Distance Uniqueness","display":"prop-unique-decoding-radius — Half Distance Uniqueness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-prop-unique-decoding-radius","aliases":["28-prop-unique-decoding-radius"],"type":"proposition","display":"prop-unique-decoding-radius — Half Distance Uniqueness","depends_on":["[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Figure 19.2 and discussion following Definition 19.5","source_printed_pages":"380","source_pdf_pages":"406","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-prop-unique-decoding-radius"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-prop-unique-decoding-radius</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-unique-decoding-radius — Half Distance Uniqueness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Figure 19.2 and discussion following Definition 19.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"380"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"406"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\Sigma,n,m,E\">\\(A,\\Sigma,n,m,E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_m^\\Sigma\">\\(\\Delta_m^\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fb76a370ebde152b\" href=\"?note=fb76a370ebde152b\" title=\"28-df-error-correcting-code\">28-df-error-correcting-code</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in(0,1]\">\\(\\delta\\in(0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\le\\rho&lt;\\delta/2\">\\(0\\le\\rho&lt;\\delta/2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E;\\delta)\">\\(\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E;\\delta)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u,v,w\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,w)\\le\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,v)+\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(v,w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u,v,w\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,w)\\le\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,v)+\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(v,w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad|\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)|\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad|\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)|\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in A^n\\ \\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad\\left(\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),y)\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)=\\{a\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in A^n\\ \\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad\\left(\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),y)\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)=\\{a\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>图19.2及 Definition 19.5 后的文字（印刷380页/PDF406页）给出半距离球互不相交的论证，本次已复核。</p>\n<p>证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i\\ne w_i\">\\(u_i\\ne w_i\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_i\\ne v_i\">\\(u_i\\ne v_i\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\\ne w_i\">\\(v_i\\ne w_i\\)</span>，故逐坐标计数得到三角不等式。若不同消息 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 同属候选列表，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\le\\Delta(E(a),E(b))\\le2\\rho&lt;\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\le\\Delta(E(a),E(b))\\le2\\rho&lt;\\delta\\)</span>，矛盾。已知某消息满足半径条件时，它属于列表，故列表恰为该单点。这只证明信息论上的唯一性，不承诺高效计算该消息。</p>\n<p>严格半径条件确有必要：二元单比特消息编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\mapsto00\">\\(0\\mapsto00\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\mapsto11\">\\(1\\mapsto11\\)</span> 的距离为一，接收字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"01\">\\(01\\)</span> 同时距两码字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span>；把条件放宽到半距离闭球会破坏唯一性。该边界例已直接逐坐标验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-error-correcting-code","status":"resolved","id":"fb76a370ebde152b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,\\Sigma,n,m,E$、$\\Delta_m^\\Sigma$、$\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}$ 见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\Sigma,n,m,E","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_m^\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\in(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"0\\le\\rho<\\delta/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ECC}_{n,m}^{A,\\Sigma}(E;\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall u,v,w\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,w)\\le\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(u,v)+\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(v,w).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad|\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)|\\le1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in A^n\\ \\forall y\\in\\Sigma^m\\quad\\left(\\Delta_m^\\Sigma(E(a),y)\\le\\rho\\Longrightarrow\\mathcal L_{E,\\rho}(y)=\\{a\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"u_i\\ne w_i","display":false},{"tex":"u_i\\ne v_i","display":false},{"tex":"v_i\\ne w_i","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\le\\Delta(E(a),E(b))\\le2\\rho<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"0\\mapsto00","display":false},{"tex":"1\\mapsto11","display":false},{"tex":"01","display":false},{"tex":"1/2","display":false}],"bytes":1878,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-242","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["fb76a370ebde152b"]}